      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2025-june/q3",
      "question": "<p>Relative to a fixed origin <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O\"></span></p><ul><li>the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\"></span> has coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3, -8)\"></span></li></ul><ul><li>the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\"></span> is such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\overrightarrow{AB} = -5\\mathbf{i} + 2\\mathbf{j}\"></span></li></ul><p>(a) Find the exact value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"|\\overrightarrow{OB}|\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(b) Find the size of angle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OAB\"></span>, giving your answer in degrees to one decimal place.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
