      "question": "<p>The circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> has equation</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"x^2 + y^2 + 10x - 4y + 1 = 0\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>(a) Find</p><p>(i) the coordinates of the centre of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span></p><p>(ii) the exact radius of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span></p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>The line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y = k\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span> is a constant, cuts <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\"></span> at two distinct points.</p><p>(b) Find the range of values for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\"></span>, giving your answer in set notation.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
