      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x) = \\frac{x^5 - 12x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{4x}\"></span></p><p>(a) Write <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span> in the form</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"ax^p + bx^q\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a, b, p\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\"></span> are simplified constants.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p><p>(b) Hence find</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int f(x) \\, dx\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>giving your answer in simplest form.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></p>",
