      "id": "exam/edexcel-8ma0-01-2025-june/q6",
      "question": "<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x) = ax^3 + bx^2 + 18x + 9\"></span></p><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span> are constants.</p><p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x + 3)\"></span> is a factor of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)\"></span></p><p>(a) show that</p><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"-3a + b = 5\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></p><p>Given also that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f&#x27;(2) = 14\"></span></p><p>(b) find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\"></span> and the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\"></span>.</p><p><span class=\"marks\">(5)</span></p>",
